WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.442 --> 00:00:02.908
Unit eighteen. Food Marketing!

2
00:00:03.812 --> 00:00:08.120
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Visal, your school doctor.

3
00:00:08.170 --> 00:00:11.207
Hi, Doctor Visal! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.257 --> 00:00:14.717
Today we learn about Food Marketing. Let's go!

5
00:00:15.409 --> 00:00:18.509
Marketing. Say it with me. Marketing!

6
00:00:22.050 --> 00:00:25.750
Advertising. Say it with me. Advertising!

7
00:00:29.264 --> 00:00:32.814
Packaging. Say it with me. Packaging!

8
00:00:36.302 --> 00:00:40.086
Health claims. Say it with me. Health claims!

9
00:00:43.578 --> 00:00:46.712
Label. Say it with me. Label!

10
00:00:50.176 --> 00:00:53.310
Sugar. Say it with me. Sugar!

11
00:00:56.810 --> 00:00:59.826
Children. Say it with me. Children!

12
00:01:03.340 --> 00:01:06.556
Choice. Say it with me. Choice!

13
00:01:10.089 --> 00:01:20.724
Food marketing uses advertising, bright packaging, and health claims to sell products, often to children. Reading the label shows real sugar and salt. Knowing this helps me make a better choice.

14
00:01:20.774 --> 00:01:23.551
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Visal!

15
00:01:24.950 --> 00:01:29.860
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:29.910 --> 00:01:31.060
Packaging!

17
00:01:32.125 --> 00:01:37.165
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:37.215 --> 00:01:38.365
Children!

19
00:01:39.182 --> 00:01:45.706
Did you know? A 'low fat' label does not always mean a food is healthy — it may be high in sugar!

20
00:01:45.756 --> 00:01:47.550
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:48.250 --> 00:01:55.749
Think and answer. What tricks does food packaging use?

22
00:01:55.799 --> 00:01:56.949
Great answer!

23
00:01:58.053 --> 00:02:02.572
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:02.622 --> 00:02:05.209
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

